<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46518" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζωόφορ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>life-giving,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				3.171
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνεμοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					9.765
				</span></i>
			 (Paul. Sil.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζῳοφόρος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <i>bearing animals</i>: and so,
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>bearing the figures of animals, sculptured</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πίνακες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					18.26
				</span></i>
			; Lat. <i>zophorus</i>, as Subst.,
			<i>frieze</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Vitr.
				3.5.10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ ζ. κύκλος</span>,= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ ζῳδιακός</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mu.</u>
				392a11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Corp.Herm.</u>
				13.12
			</span></i>, etc.; without <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύκλος</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.153
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				14.124
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφαῖρα ἡ ζ. </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζωηφ-</span> cod.) <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.294
			</span></i>.</div>
